6993054_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aPk7U8DRJtAQ7kNvwEC3gWR&_nc_oc=AdrTsZRsA1RaZ2SlA51M70uPDopN0DlmoDoQJkTgzhwLGrkT-vqYew7KskK1hwhmhy8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWUkIpLYpTR2YOC8q8vTfKe9OUY-kubjT9KqvCabA1T-w&oe=6B1046D3"}, "display_name": "Dinosaur Prehistoric Hunter VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Step into a dangerous prehistoric VR world where survival means hunting or being hunted. In Dinosaur Prehistoric Hunter VR, you explore a dense jungle packed with 9 deadly dinosaur species, including the legendary T-Rex and fast, aggressive raptors. Every creature has lifelike animations and smart AI that can chase, attack, and corner you.\n\nArm yourself with a powerful MP5, shotgun, handgun, bow & arrow, or sword and choose your combat style. Go loud in intense firefights, pick off enemies from a distance, or take the close-range path and slash through the danger with a sword. With survival tension, free-hunt exploration, and nonstop dinosaur action, every session feels different.\n\nBuilt for Meta Quest, the game features immersive 3D sound, detailed environments, intuitive VR controls, and optimized performance for a smooth headset experience.", "short_description": "Enter a thrilling prehistoric VR survival hunt where every encounter can turn deadly. Fight 9 dinosaur species, including T-Rex and raptors, using MP5, shotgun, handgun, bow & arrow, or sword. Explore a dense jungle, survive intense close-range combat, and enjoy realistic graphics, immersive 3D audio, and smooth Meta Quest controls."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ab Dur Rehman", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_ca